Package: rcvr
Title: Classifies and Cleans Cast Vote Records
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mason", "Reece", , "masonreece1317@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-8761-2344"))
Description: Parses raw Cast Vote Records (CVRs) exported by election
    vendors in a variety of delimited, JSON, XML, and county-specific
    formats into a single common pairs frame, and provides tools to seed
    and reconcile candidate, party, and contest metadata against a
    persistent store. Built to support large-scale, multi-county election
    research where CVR formats vary widely by vendor and jurisdiction.
